    "description": "Are you a skilled Quality Control Engineer looking for your next big career move? Amara Raja Batteries Global Group in Pimpri-Chinchwad offers you the perfect platform to grow professionally and personally.\n\nAbout Amara Raja Batteries Global Group:\nAmara Raja Batteries Global Group is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Maintain accurate production records and prepare daily reports\n• Implement lean manufacturing and continuous improvement initiatives\n• Implement 5S, Kaizen, and Six Sigma practices on the shop floor\n• Ensure compliance with safety regulations and factory acts\n• Conduct root cause analysis for quality rejections and defects\n• Ensure environmental compliance and waste management\n• Coordinate with logistics for dispatching finished goods\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Com / M.Com / MBA Finance\n• 1-3 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Quality Control\n• Proficiency in Six Sigma\n• Proficiency in Statistical Process Control\n• Proficiency in PPAP\n• Proficiency in FMEA\n• Proficiency in SolidWorks\n• Proficiency in Kaizen\n• Proficiency in SAP MM/PP\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Referral bonus program\n• Annual performance appraisal\n• Modern office with recreational facilities\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Salary Range: 4 LPA - 9 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Pimpri-Chinchwad, Maharashtra, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Amara Raja Batteries Global Group!",
